ISO-10303-21;
/* Tsh247: OPEN_SHELL with TWO ADVANCED_FACEs — a CYLINDRICAL_SURFACE (radius 5, axis +Z) quarter-patch and a PLANE at x=5 (normal +X, matching the cylinder's own outward radial normal at theta=0) — sharing the SAME EDGE_CURVE entity (the vertical generatrix line x=5,y=0,z:[0,10]) as their common boundary; the shared edge is genuinely G1-tangent (plane-tangent-to-cylinder), not a sharp crease, so BRepLib::EncodeRegularity (invoked unconditionally on the default STEP read path via ShapeFix::EncodeRegularity) must classify it as smooth */
